@startuml
title Agent Orchestrator Desktop - Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
actor User

rectangle "Agent Orchestrator Desktop" {
    usecase "Execute Single Agent Run" as UC1
    usecase "Execute Multi-step Workflow" as UC2
    usecase "Switch AI Engine" as UC3
    usecase "Retry Failed Run" as UC4
    usecase "Retry with Engine Override" as UC5
    usecase "View Real-time Logs" as UC6
    usecase "Cancel Active Task" as UC7

    usecase "Browse Organization Hierarchy" as UC8
    usecase "View Dashboard Metrics" as UC9
    usecase "Edit Skills/Agents (Inspector)" as UC10
    usecase "Chat with AI Sidepanel" as UC11
    usecase "Switch UI Theme" as UC12
    usecase "Design Workflow Visually" as UC13
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3
User --> UC4
User --> UC5
User --> UC6
User --> UC7
User --> UC8
User --> UC9
User --> UC10
User --> UC11
User --> UC12
User --> UC13

UC5 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC1 : <<extend>>

note right of UC3
  Codex | Gemini (Phase 1-4)
  OpenCode | ClaudeCode (Phase 5)
end note

@enduml
